    return true;
}
```

The issue is:
1. `divide_length=128` - compress every 128 tokens
2. `kv_budget=2048` - only compress when committed > 2048
3. But if tests use short contexts (< 2048 tokens), compression never triggers!

The real problem: **short test contexts never reach kv_budget threshold, so compression is skipped**

